OL,3,GNEWSAPicture books to help children
OL,4,Aunderstand dementia
OL,5,
OL,6,FChildren across Jersey will be given
OL,7,Faccess to books designed to help them
OL,8,Funderstand dementia.
OL,10,FEvery Child Our Future and Dementia
OL,11,FJersey have partnered up to provide
OL,12,Fpicture books which explore dementia in
OL,13,F"sensitive and age-appropriate ways".
OL,14,FThe books are set to be distributed
OL,15,Famong schools and community groups
OL,16,Facross the island.
OL,18,FCEO of Dementia Jersey Claudine Snape
OL,19,Fsaid dementia often affected families,
OL,20,Fincluding children.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
