OL,3,GNEWSAPicture books to help children
OL,4,Aunderstand dementia
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Having books that we can share with
OL,7,Fschools and recommend to families is a
OL,8,Freally valuable way of helping children
OL,9,Funderstand dementia in a language that
OL,10,Ffeels accessible and reassuring," she
OL,11,Fsaid.
